<Layout title="About this site" canonicalPath="/about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="page-head" style="padding-top:24px">
      <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
      <h1 style="margin-top:8px">About this site</h1>
      <p>An independent, AI-assisted educational reference on the Income-tax Act, 2025.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="prose"><p>Each article follows one fixed structure: the official provision, a plain-language explanation, an example, related rules, official guidance, case law and a 1961 comparison, with sources at the end.</p><p>Articles are researched and drafted with AI assistance against official sources. <b>They have not been written or reviewed by a Chartered Accountant, advocate or other licensed professional</b> unless a page says so. The short “Practical Notes” section in each article is AI-assisted interpretation, always kept separate from the law.</p><p>Found a mistake? Please <a href="/contact">tell us</a> — accuracy matters more than speed here.</p></div>
  </div>
</Layout>
